  "details": "People in certain groups should be denied access to the main group instances that the owner has certain groups blocked. <prevents crasher and hackers from ever joining. >this could upset people but its so worth implementing imagine all those hostel groups that are still up preventing its members from coming in and crashing everyone.\n\nBasically cant join the instance unless they are not in that group.\n\nAvatar blacklist in settings or just in the instances pin menu pressing on the users collider you can turn there avatar off in the group instance preventing everyone from seeing it(admin only though). < this would only account for the avatar id and nothing more. Preventing the joiner from using suicide crashers on spawn or just avatars groups dont generally allow.\n\nThese are totally possible but its up to the groups on how they use them.\n\nTupper how close are we to have full on group 18+ verification?",
